WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.067
Let's go now to Claire

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.702
Sebastian in London.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.703
Claire, good morning.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.270
Both sides

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.972
bracing for that much

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.407
discussed counteroffensive.

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:08.942
What more can you tell us?

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.510
Yeah, I think at this point,

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.680
it is fairly clear it has to be imminent,

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:15.882
or at least that we're very deep

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:16.516
into what appears

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.651
to be shaping or softening operations

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:19.719
on the Ukrainian side.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.755
And that part of that is happening

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.456
in the information space.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.425
The deputy defense minister of Ukraine

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:28.161
putting out over the weekend this video.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.797
Take a quick look at that.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.545
So this clearly urging silence

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.213
around this counter offensive.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.349
The caption of the video is Plans

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:51.251
Love, silence, the beginning

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.253
we see meaning of the offensive

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.821
will not be announced.

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.022
The effects, though,

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:57.690
quite the opposite, keeps us talking

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.758
about the counter-offensive.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:00:59.626
It follows on

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:00.326
from another video

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:00.894
by the commander

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:02.429
in chief of the Ukrainian armed forces

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:03.496
just over a week ago.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.732
Similarly, trailer style

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.666
showing Ukrainian troops

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.701
training, showcasing Western weapons.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.537
They are allowing the suspense

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:11.871
to build around this,

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:12.572
presumably

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.240
so that Russia does not have time

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.241
to take a pause,

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.743
to regroup, to retool,

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:17.544
and they can continue

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.612
to probe their defenses.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:20.447
Combine that, of course,

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:21.514
with the ramp

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.182
up in

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:24.117
incident attacks across the border,

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.985
which I'm clearly was just talking about.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.420
And this morning as well, Russia,

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.254
not to be outdone,

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.823
putting out its own video.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.058
The Ministry of Defense of what it says

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:35.528
is a foiled Ukrainian large scale

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:38.498
offensive in the southern Donetsk region,

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.499
which it says it was.

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:40.300
This is the video here.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.068
It was able to destroy a large amount

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.637
of Ukrainian equipment and troops.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:45.872
We've not been able to verify

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:46.773
that the Ukrainian side

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.041
is not admitting to it.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:48.942
And in fact,

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:49.576
this morning,

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.277
the communication directorate

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.046
of the Ukrainian Armed Forces warning

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:55.048
that Russia is intensifying

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.549
information operations,

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.818
including about the counter offensive.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:01:59.819
So the information space

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.387
is very important there.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.489
But overall, president,

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:03.389
let's go over the weekend

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:04.524
saying in an interview

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:05.458
with The Wall Street Journal

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.227
that they are basically ready.

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:08.094
Even without,

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:10.430
he says, the addition of F-16 fighter

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:11.731
jets later.

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.134
Sebastian reporting, thank you as always.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.205
Russia is trying to send a

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:20.640
message that it's ready

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.841
to wipe out Ukraine's

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.510
counteroffensive before it

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.944
officially begins.

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:25.778
A Russian appointed

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.780
official in occupied separate

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.949
Georgia claims Russian forces

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:31.951
have repelled a Ukrainian attack

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.287
in the neighboring Donetsk region.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:35.188
He also says

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:36.990
Russian forces have pushed back

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.058
a Ukrainian advance on the front lines.

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:40.426
Ukrainian officials,

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.128
however, are refusing to comment

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.496
and it's difficult to assess

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.231
what might be an offense

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:48.902
offensive as opposed to probing moves.

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:50.637
Well, all that happening

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:52.038
after a weekend of deadly attacks

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.940
on Ukrainian cities and inside

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.642
Russian territory.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.143
Sam Kiley brings us the latest

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.779
now from eastern Ukraine.

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:00.813
Once again,

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:02.715
if ever there was needed proof

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:03.449
that the Russians

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.251
were continuing to target civilians

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.619
they've given it this time

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.188
with a missile

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:09.889
strike by an Iskander

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:11.591
missile on a residential building

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:13.593
close to the city of Danny Pro.

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.361
A two year old child was killed

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:16.563
17 people,

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.298
according to local authorities,

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:19.199
were injured.

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:20.633
This just the latest

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.635
of the civilian deaths

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:24.837
that have hit this country

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.473
after almost nightly missile attacks.

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:29.008
Russian missile strikes

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:29.776
once again

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:31.411
renewing their calls for help

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.012
from the international community

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:34.547
with their air defenses.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:36.082
But similar calls are coming

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:37.850
from authorities inside

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.852
Russia in the border areas.

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:41.821
Now, they say under bombardment

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:42.722
from Ukraine

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.557
or from Ukrainian backed

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:45.758
Russian dissidents

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.628
who split into two different groups

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:49.862
have attacked

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:50.730
villages

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.332
across a substantial

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:53.933
stretch of territory.

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:57.036
Now, inside Russia, just across

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:57.870
the northern border

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.639
with Ukraine, with the local authorities

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:00.173
there

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:01.975
saying over the last ten days

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:02.809
or so, at least seven

00:04:02.809 --> 00:04:04.143
civilians have been killed.

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:06.246
4000 have had to have been evacuated

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:08.414
from a number of towns and villages

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:10.083
where they've been burning buildings

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:12.585
and a number of artillery strikes

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:14.520
that they blamed on the Ukrainians.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.488
And the Russian dissidents

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:16.155
have paraded

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:18.291
a number of prisoners of war,

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:19.993
at least the people they claim

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:20.793
to be prisoners

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:21.728
of war,

00:04:21.728 --> 00:04:23.062
Russian prisoners of war

00:04:23.062 --> 00:04:25.898
that they've offered today to exchange

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:27.533
with the local governor

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:28.868
if he agreed to meet them.

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:30.837
He didn't make the rendezvous.

00:04:30.837 --> 00:04:32.772
And so they've posted online

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:33.573
a commitment now

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:35.141
to hand those prisoners of war

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:36.909
over to the Ukrainian authorities.

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:39.045
We've got no independent way of proving

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:39.812
whether or not

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.614
these men were prisoners of war.

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:42.815
But we do know

00:04:42.815 --> 00:04:44.350
that these Russian dissidents

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.818
are very fast on the draw

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:47.820
when it comes to social media.

00:04:47.987 --> 00:04:50.590
This is very much part of their campaign

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:52.025
to try to spread

00:04:52.025 --> 00:04:53.259
the dissident message

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:55.128
to try to spread ultimately

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:56.362
some kind of revolution

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:57.463
against Vladimir Putin

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:58.731
in the last few days.

00:04:58.731 --> 00:05:01.467
He has picked up that energy, responding

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:05.438
in exhorting his subordinates not to fall

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:07.073
for the forces

00:05:07.073 --> 00:05:08.641
and not to allow those forces

00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:10.710
to catch fire in their own country.

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:14.147
Sam Kiley, CNN, Eastern Ukraine.

